{"4810200":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Block Siege","steam_appid":4810200,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a defense. Find a weakness. Take the shot.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block Siege is a 3D physics strategy game that combines freeform building with hands-on cannon battles. Construct a fortress from different materials, position your cannons, then aim and fire. Your defenses must withstand the impact while your shots search for a way through.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every material is a tactical choice<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build with bricks, rock, steel, jelly and triangular supports. Spend your construction budget, reinforce key positions and balance protection against clear firing angles. Build taller, add another layer, or conceal what matters most. Put your design to the test.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aim, fire and watch the walls fall<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy multiple cannons, switch firing positions and adjust your direction and power. Colliding projectiles, tumbling blocks and collapsing structures make the results of each shot visible. Study the opposing layout and look for a vulnerable spot.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two battlefields. Two ways to fight.<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Crystal: protect your Crystal Heart and destroy your opponent's to win.<br><\/li><li>Dam: hold back the flood and breach the opposing dam.<br><\/li><li>Turn-based and Free modes: plan each alternating shot or trade fire as your cannons reload.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find your own approach<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine tools such as glue, oil and smoke, then challenge AI opponents with different difficulty levels and building styles. Visit the practice range to build and test your structures without an opponent or a win condition.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build strong. Aim true.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a defense. Find a weakness. Take the shot.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block Siege is a 3D physics strategy game that combines freeform building with hands-on cannon battles. Construct a fortress from different materials, position your cannons, then aim and fire. Your defenses must withstand the impact while your shots search for a way through.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every material is a tactical choice<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build with bricks, rock, steel, jelly and triangular supports. Spend your construction budget, reinforce key positions and balance protection against clear firing angles. Build taller, add another layer, or conceal what matters most. Put your design to the test.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aim, fire and watch the walls fall<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy multiple cannons, switch firing positions and adjust your direction and power. Colliding projectiles, tumbling blocks and collapsing structures make the results of each shot visible. Study the opposing layout and look for a vulnerable spot.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two battlefields. Two ways to fight.<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Crystal: protect your Crystal Heart and destroy your opponent's to win.<br><\/li><li>Dam: hold back the flood and breach the opposing dam.<br><\/li><li>Turn-based and Free modes: plan each alternating shot or trade fire as your cannons reload.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find your own approach<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine tools such as glue, oil and smoke, then challenge AI opponents with different difficulty levels and building styles. Visit the practice range to build and test your structures without an opponent or a win condition.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build strong. Aim true.<\/p>","short_description":"Build your fortress, position your cannons and blast through enemy defenses in a 3D physics strategy game. Experiment with bricks, steel and jelly across Crystal and Dam modes. Plan each turn or trade fire in Free mode.","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4810200\/c277eb603968b07b88eea5e2c3047b26ba41e722\/header.jpg?t=1793690930","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4810200\/3c3b1043e8455488459b83b24ecf30250065b9f8\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793690930","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4810200\/3c3b1043e8455488459b83b24ecf30250065b9f8\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793690930","website":"https:\/\/bs.magicalconch.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4096　 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11 capable GPU, 2 GB VRAM (e.g. NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti \/ Intel UHD 630)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2048 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX compatible<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8192　 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 \/ AMD RX 560 or better, 4 GB VRAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 8192 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX compatible<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 11 Big Sur<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 409